    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, height: '100%', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 14 }}>
      <Box style={{ background: '#F0F5FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 12, padding: '18px 20px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10, flex: 1 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>教学启示</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.8 }}>最该先讲的两条衔接：</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.8 }}>① 数系两次扩张——实数到复数，回答「数还能是什么」；<br />② 三个二次统一——方程、不等式、函数在函数观点下合流。</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.8 }}>初中复习课按线索组织，比按册别组织更能激活高中接口。</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ background: '#0E3F8C', borderRadius: 10, padding: '12px 20px' }}>
